WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:10.950
I found that since the bylaw was
passed by the council and came into

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:16.619
operation, that the vehicles on the beach
have gone down considerably. You rarely

00:00:16.619 --> 00:00:21.140
see a vehicle on the beach now, so people are really buying into it

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:26.579
and already we're seeing an improvement
so yeah it's been good. And we'll carry on

00:00:26.579 --> 00:00:31.980
you know, we have to carry on, to keep
the word up and not let it lapse so

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:38.370
that goes back to what it was like in past times.
And I think while ECAN and its

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:43.050
rangers have probably most important
role in terms of explaining and educating

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:46.560
getting that information out, that there's lots of other groups we have residents

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:51.120
associations or community board or
whatnot but we have to support them we

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:55.380
shoulder some of that burden and feed
that information out into the sort of

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:59.040
networks that we work and operate in.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.840
We've got to consult with each other

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.600
and talk with each other and

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.270
come to an arrangement that works for
everybody and I think that's the

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:11.940
implementation process, is what that's
about.

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:17.100
There's a conversation in trying to work
out how we can all exist and coexist

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:19.360
together for the harmony of all.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:25.520
I agree and it's about getting all users to buy into it,

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:29.320
for the benefit of all.

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:37.040
It is recognising just how special this
area is and we forget each of us

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:40.640
are talking about things that we see as
being important,

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:44.720
but it is a very very special area.

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:51.200
It is, it's a taonga, a treasure, and a part of that is educating all

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:57.240
recreational users about the specialness to each and every one of us and how we see it.

